OL,3,ARussell Brand was 'ruthless' and a
OL,4,A'sexual predator', prosecutors allege
OL,5,Aas rape trial begins
OL,6,
OL,7,FProsecutors describe Russell Brand as
OL,8,F"ruthless" and a "sexual predator" as
OL,9,Fthe 51-year-old goes on trial on
OL,10,Fcharges of rape and sexual assault
OL,12,FOpening the prosecution's case, Riel
OL,13,FKarmy-Jones KC tells Southwark Crown
OL,14,FCourt Brand had a "childlike"
OL,15,Fexpectation that his "voracious"
OL,16,Fdesires should be met
OL,18,FReferring to testimony from a former
OL,19,Ffriend of Brand's, Karmy-Jones says the
OL,20,Fcomedian and actor once said he wanted
OL,21,Fto "bed 5,000 women" - here's what else
OL,22,Fwe heard
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
