OL,3,ARussell Brand was 'ruthless' and a
OL,4,A'sexual predator', prosecutors allege
OL,5,Aas rape trial begins
OL,6,
OL,7,FBrand has pleaded not guilty to three
OL,8,Fcounts of rape, three counts of sexual
OL,9,Fassault and one count of indecent
OL,10,Fassault
OL,12,FThe allegations date from 1999-2009 and
OL,13,Fcome from six women - legally entitled
OL,14,Fto lifelong anonymity - who the
OL,15,Fprosecution says came forward
OL,16,F"independently of each other"
OL,18,FArriving at court earlier, Brand said
OL,19,Fhe felt "blessed", adding: "I feel of
OL,20,Fcourse concerned but hopeful this
OL,21,Fprocess will lead to good outcomes for
OL,22,Feverybody"
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
