OL,3,ABadenoch presses Burnham on benefits
OL,4,Aand Brexit vote claims at PMQs
OL,5,
OL,6,FKemi Badenoch presses Andy Burnham on
OL,7,Fbenefits and his claims of Russian
OL,8,Finterference in the 2016 Brexit
OL,9,Freferendum at PMQs
OL,11,FThe PM says the UK needs to "call out"
OL,12,Fhostile actors, while Badenoch asks if
OL,13,FBurnham agrees with the head of MI5 who
OL,14,Fhas said talking up Russian
OL,15,Finterference is a mistake
OL,17,FBadenoch also questions the PM on
OL,18,Fenergy security and asks him to stop
OL,19,F"faffing about" with decisions over the
OL,20,FRosebank and Jackdaw oil and gas fields
OL,21,Fin the North Sea
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
